  "question_stem": "A particle $P$ moves in a straight line. The acceleration $a$ m s$^{-2}$ of $P$ at time $t$ s is given by $a = 6t - 12$. The displacement of $P$ from a fixed point $O$ on the line is $s$ m. It is given that $s = 5$ when $t = 1$ and $s = 1$ when $t = 3$.",
